  <ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock id="f-12" contextRef="c-1">&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Prairie Wind Transmission, LLC is owned 50% by Evergy Kansas Central, Inc., formerly known as Westar Energy, Inc., a wholly-owned subsidiary of Evergy, Inc., 25% by AEP Transmission Holding Company, LLC, a wholly-owned subsidiary of American Electric Power Company, Inc., and 25% by BHE America Transco, LLC, an indirect wholly-owned subsidiary of Berkshire Hathaway Energy Company.&lt;/span&gt;</ferc:ControlOverRespondentTextBlock>
